href=\"/wiki/%E5%B8%95%E7%B1%B3%E5%9F%83\" title=\"帕米埃\"><img alt=\"帕米埃\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/ba/HeadIconSmall-302201.png/100px-HeadIconSmall-302201.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"img-fit\" srcset=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/b/ba/HeadIconSmall-302201.png 1.5x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></a></span></span></span><span class=\"tooltips\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E5%B8%95%E7%B1%B3%E5%9F%83\" title=\"帕米埃\">帕米埃</a></span></span></div><div><div><span class=\"color-darkgold\" style=\"margin-right:1em\">实装版本：</span>1.5</div></div><div><div><span class=\"color-darkgold\" style=\"margin-right:3em\">来源：</span>点唱机</div></div><div><div><span class=\"color-darkgold\" style=\"margin-right:1em\">所属系列：</span>红土地</div></div><div><div class=\"grey-small test-hide hide-m\">编号ID：302203</div></div></div></div><h2><span id=\".E7.AA.97.E4.B8.AD.E4.BE.A7.E5.86.99_Garment_Display\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"窗中侧写_Garment_Display\">窗中侧写<small style=\"color: grey\"> <span style=\"display:inline-block\">Garment Display</span></small></span></h2><div class=\"infopad\">当她身着运动服出现在赛场上时，基金会大部分新职员并没有第一时间发现她的到场。在基金会职员眼中，特别裁判所的成员应该永驻光洁亮丽的殿堂，穿着标准华美的制服进行审判，那才是唯一合规且得体的画面。当友人看到帕米埃走向标枪赛场时，她催促场地记者赶紧调转镜头，毕竟能看到帕米埃放下剑的机会并不多。<br />这并不是帕米埃第一次参加乌卢鲁运动会，在她的私人日程表上，她为每一场运动会都预留了参赛时间。在乌卢鲁运动会还未传至欧洲的年代，象征着公平竞技精神的奥运会，曾因被罗马皇帝独断地宣布为非法而销声匿迹，而乌卢鲁也曾有过类似的命运。在回看历史后，帕米埃深知乌卢鲁运动会复兴的不易，她热衷于出现在红土地的赛场上，或许并不是因为对胜利的渴望，只是出于对自古以来那些蛮横独裁的律令的不满。</div><div id=\"崭新单品\"></div><h2><span id=\".E5.B4.AD.E6.96.B0.E5.8D.95.E5.93.81_All-new_Item\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"崭新单品_All-new_Item\">崭新单品<small style=\"color: grey\"> <span style=\"display:inline-block\">All-new Item</span></small></span></h2><div class=\"char-item-box0 tabber\"><div class=\"char-item-box1 tabber-item\" data-skinid=\"302203\"><div class=\"char-item-box2\"><div style=\"margin: 0 -20px;\"><div class=\"char-item-img\"><img alt=\"Belonging-302204.png\" src=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/6/68/Belonging-302204.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"484\" height=\"444\" class=\"img-fit\" data-file-width=\"484\" data-file-height=\"444\" /><div class=\"title\">穿越穹顶<div class=\"grey-small\" style=\"text-wrap:wrap\">Piercing the Sky</div></div></div><div>无估值<hr style=\"margin:6px 0 10px 0; clear:both\" /></div><div>将白榆木作为枪身材料，辅以软垫方便握持。<br />或因此物曾用于另一种用途，她使用起来相当得心应手。</div></div></div><div class=\"char-item-box2\"><div style=\"margin: 0 -20px;\"><div class=\"char-item-img\"><img alt=\"Belonging-302205.png\" src=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/a/a2/Belonging-302205.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"484\" height=\"444\" class=\"img-fit\" data-file-width=\"484\" data-file-height=\"444\" /><div class=\"title\">Z型弹力护腕<div class=\"grey-small\" style=\"text-wrap:wrap\">Elastic Wristbands</div></div></div><div>无估值<div class=\"grey-small\" style=\"float: right;\">信任达到60%解锁</div><hr style=\"margin:6px 0 10px 0; clear:both\" /></div><div>Z型网格的束带，紧覆于肘关节的护腕，使佩戴者能安全进行任意剧烈动作。<br />曾长久运用于铅球、帆船运动，审美与实用兼具的好东西。</div></div></div><div class=\"char-item-box2\"><div style=\"margin: 0 -20px;\"><div class=\"char-item-img\"><img alt=\"Belonging-302206.png\" src=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/b/b1/Belonging-302206.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"484\" height=\"444\" class=\"img-fit\" data-file-width=\"484\" data-file-height=\"444\" /><div class=\"title\">满弓者1号用鞋<div class=\"grey-small\" style=\"text-wrap:wrap\">\"The Thrower 1\"</div></div></div><div>无估值<div class=\"grey-small\" style=\"float: right;\">信任达到100%解锁</div><hr style=\"margin:6px 0 10px 0; clear:both\" /></div><div>标枪投掷比赛的专业用鞋，侧后方写有“飞跃始于足下”。曾短暂出现于巴黎冬季运动时装秀，人们对此趋之若鹜，但很快发现它并不适合日常穿戴。</div></div></div></div></div><h2><span id=\".E8.A1.A3.E7.9D.80.E6.B5.B7.E6.8A.A5\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"衣着海报\">衣着海报</span></h2><div style=\"display:flex; gap:10px; border:1px solid #b55829; width:fit-content\"><